# ONE GPC to OPS 201 with its IMUs in operate -- the bench for the vehicle
# dynamics (yaGPC2's YAGPC_MDM_DEVICES=1 YAGPC_VEHDYN=1).
#
# WHY THE SPEC 21 STEP.  In OPS 2 the flight software uses an IMU's resolver
# data (and so knows the vehicle's attitude at all) only for an IMU it has
# recorded as IN OPERATE (CGMB_IMU_INOP_IPG).  A real orbiter brought that
# state up from OPS 9, where the IMUs were put in operate on the pad, through
# OPS 1.  This vehicle goes straight from OPS 0 to OPS 2, and in OPS 2 the
# only thing that sets the flag is the SPEC 21 IMU ALIGN display supervisor
# (GX4DIS): for each IMU commanded to OPER whose in-operate discrete is on.
# It runs only while SPEC 21 is displayed, so the display is left up for a
# few seconds after the three OPER items.  (Ledger #263.)
#
# Run, for example, with the vehicle started turning, to watch the AUTO DAP
# fire the jets and bring it back:
#   YAGPC_MDM_DEVICES=1 YAGPC_VEHDYN=1 YAGPC_VEHDYN_RATE=0,0,0.5 \
#     python3 simulatePASS.py --gpcs 1 --crts 1 --tape <tape> \
#     --script examples/1gpc-ops201-imu.script
# (one line when typed).  The attitude and rates on UNIV PTG then follow the
# vehicle, and yaGPC2's "vehdyn:" line at shutdown reports the jet-seconds
# and the propellant used.

+0     gpc 1
+0     mode HALT
+0.02  idppower 1 on
+0.01  script ipl-one-gpc.script gpc=1 crt=1 idp=1 kb=KB1

+11    keys ITEM 1 + 2 EXEC
+8     keys ITEM 2 + 1 EXEC
+8     keys ITEM 7 + 1 EXEC
+8     keys ITEM 8 + 1 EXEC
+8     keys ITEM 9 + 1 EXEC
+8     keys ITEM 1 0 + 1 EXEC
+8     keys ITEM 1 1 + 1 EXEC
+8     keys ITEM 1 2 + 1 EXEC
+8     keys ITEM 1 8 + 1 EXEC
+8     keys ITEM 1 9 + 1 EXEC
+21    keys OPS 2 0 1 PRO

# FREE DRIFT FIRST.  The orbit DAP comes up in AUTO, and an IMU coming into
# operate under it is a jump in the attitude the DAP is flying on: it read
# that as a rotation and fired against it -- a 2.5 s pitch burst to 3.2
# deg/s at the first IMU, braked at the second, a roll correction at the
# third (ledger #270).  The vehicle never does this in flight, where the
# IMUs are up long before; here, with the DAP in FREE while they come up,
# no jet fires at all.  (C3 FREE: panelO6's ORBITAL DAP pushbutton.)
+30    dap c3 free

# IMUs 1-3 to OPER on SPEC 21, and leave it up while the software notes them.
+10    keys SPEC 2 1 PRO
+5     keys ITEM 4 EXEC
+3     keys ITEM 5 EXEC
+3     keys ITEM 6 EXEC
+15    keys RESUME

# Back to AUTO, now that the attitude is the IMUs'.
+5     dap c3 auto
